  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><p>Parameter of other end of focal chord is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;Point is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;Equation of tangent is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
